              "id": "moves_between_sessions",
              "text": "The n=43 member was measured at 100.422778, 100.443522, 100.446474 and 100.464646 MHz in the four captures of 2026-09-13 and 2026-09-15 - a 41.9 kHz spread, i.e. f0 wandering from 2.335413 to 2.336387 MHz, 417 ppm, over two days. The two broadcast stations in this capture are within 1.34 kHz and 56 Hz of their channels. Free-running, unstabilised oscillators move like this; licensed carriers do not."
            },
            {
              "id": "steady_and_content_free",
              "text": "Continuous for all 45 s at constant power (50 ms block power varying under 0.5 dB) with statistics that do not change: this is a device left running, not a transmission."
