              "hypothesis": "stereo FM broadcast",
              "how": "no 19 kHz pilot (+0.22 dB over the local median against +35.5 and +8.7 dB for the two real stations and +0.39 dB for the 100.300 MHz negative control); 28 kHz occupied bandwidth against 120-128 kHz for a station"
